<title>USA: Fed announces overnight, fixed system repo totals.</title>
<headline>Fed announces overnight, fixed system repo totals.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said it added temporary reserves to the banking system Thursday morning via a round of overnight system repurchase agreements and a seven-day fixed system RP.</p>
<p>The overnight system totaled $3.100 billion, while the seven-day system totaled $3.969 billion, a New York Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
